    rdfs:label "holder-side waking-entries recall scope"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "A shared specification requesting holder-side waking entries of the kind held by the actual current solitude entry, excluding that exact entry."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the actual current entry and its source kind are supplied."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid inventing a fixed waking taxonomy or typing generated text as phenomenal Experience."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Supply lens/domain, selected state/solitude anchor, exact current entry, actual record kind and source order/frame."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Kind and current-entry identity remain actual inputs; the specification neither generates a thought nor asserts consciousness."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "Earlier same-kind entries are requested while the exact current entry is set aside."@x-gmeow-english .

gmeow:recallScopeHolderSawNamedAgent
    a gmeow:RecallScope ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/recall-context> ;
