    rdfs:label "holder-side saw-named-agent recall scope"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "A shared specification requesting holder-side seen-act records of an explicitly supplied target Agent, independently of the current speaker."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use for sightings of the actual named target Agent."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid deriving the target from a hard-coded person, a name string, pair ranking or the current speaker alone."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Supply actual lens/domain, target Agent, seen-act/actor evidence and source order with its temporal interpretation."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "This selector is distinct from seeing the current speaker here; no current place or pair membership is invented."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "The supplied target can differ from the current speaker without changing the selected record domain."@x-gmeow-english .

gmeow:recallScopeHolderDreamEntries
    a gmeow:RecallScope ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/recall-context> ;
