    skos:scopeNote "This is one grouped scope, distinct from LastOfOtherPairMember. Missing contact evidence is not a negative contact fact or permission to read words."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "The request keeps separate latest heard/seen selections for both members and only admitted contact time/channel metadata."@x-gmeow-english .

gmeow:recallScopeHolderAddressedToneReading
    a gmeow:RecallScope ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/recall-context> ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox ;
    rdfs:label "holder-side addressed-tone-reading recall scope"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "A shared specification requesting an actual named/versioned process reading of the tone of the exact currently addressed words, under its own source frame."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use for a source-supported refinement of the exact current words."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid substituting the words, the holder’s own utterance or a claim about the speaker’s inner state."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Supply actual lens/domain, state/exchange, exact words and the named/versioned refiner’s actual evidence and frame; keep competing readings separate."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "A reading is neither the words nor the holder’s own state. The request performs no classifier, cue match or truth inference."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "An actual refiner’s tone reading remains attributed separately from the addressed words and speaker."@x-gmeow-english .

[ a logic:ClosureEntry ; logic:closureKey "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/contextPlanHolder" ; logic:closureValue logic:ClosedWorldClosure ] .
